This package includes a TypeScript adaptation of the Delaunator advancing-hull Delaunay algorithm.

Delaunator
Copyright (c) 2017, Vladimir Agafonkin
License: ISC
Repository: https://github.com/mapbox/delaunator

The adaptation in src/delaunator_backend.ts is vendored to avoid runtime dependencies and is modified to use this package's coordinate-form adaptive predicates plus a dynamically sized legalization stack.
